{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Braiding.crossing_energy_channels"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.isLeast_energy_iff_isLeast_count_of_writhe_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.isLeast_energy_iff_isLeast_count_of_writhe_eq","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.lean#L181-L195","doc":"**The energy-minimal presentation is the count-minimal one.** Over any\nfinite nonempty family of presentations sharing a writhe — which is what a\nbraid class is, the writhe being invariant — minimising `crossingEnergy` and\nminimising the crossing count are the same problem. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.crossingEnergy_sub_eq_writhe_term_of_count_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.crossingEnergy_sub_eq_writhe_term_of_count_eq","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.lean#L147-L156","doc":"**At fixed count the two energies differ by exactly the writhe term.** This\nis the whole of the disagreement between the costs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.energy_le_iff_count_le_of_writhe_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.energy_le_iff_count_le_of_writhe_eq","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.lean#L127-L145","doc":"**At fixed writhe the two costs are the same ordering.** Stated as an `iff`,\nso it says the orderings coincide rather than merely agreeing one way. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.crossingEnergy_lt_of_cancelling_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.crossingEnergy_lt_of_cancelling_pair","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.lean#L119-L125","doc":"**The energy is a word functional, not a braid invariant.** A cancelling\npair changes no braid element and no Markov trace, and strictly raises the\nenergy. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.sub_inv_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.sub_inv_pos","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.lean#L111-L117","doc":"For a substrate parameter `1 < q` the gap `q − q⁻¹` is strictly positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.crossingEnergy_cancelling_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.crossingEnergy_cancelling_pair","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.lean#L103-L109","doc":"Inserting a cancelling pair fixes the writhe and raises the count by two,\nso the energy rises by exactly `q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.crossingEnergy_eq_of_writhe_and_count_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.crossingEnergy_eq_of_writhe_and_count_eq","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.lean#L95-L101","doc":"Equal writhe **and** equal count force equal energy: the forced tie. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.asymChannel_eq_of_count_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.asymChannel_eq_of_count_eq","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.lean#L89-L93","doc":"`asymChannel` reads only the crossing count `p + m`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.symChannel_eq_of_writhe_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.symChannel_eq_of_writhe_eq","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.lean#L83-L87","doc":"`symChannel` reads only the writhe `p − m`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.crossingEnergy_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.crossingEnergy_split","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CrossingEnergySelectionEqualsCount.lean#L75-L81","doc":"The corpus split, restated here so the file is self-contained:\n`crossingEnergy = symChannel + asymChannel`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}